   "alt": "The bright entrance hall of a friendly hospital, painted in ink and gouache: through the wide open glass doors on the far left a small smiling ambulance with a lance-shaped aerial waits; a patient in striped pyjamas stretches out on a lounger with a teacup, wiggling his toes; a kneeling nurse's assistant opens a red first-aid kit for a boy while his teddy holds a box of plasters; behind a half-open green curtain a surgeon sings opera while mending a teddy; a grandma twirls a hula hoop round her hip; a hedgehog nurse races a trolley along the green floor line; a blue door and a yellow door lead deeper inside; above them hangs a white enamel tray of little figurines; a tall nurse on stilts hands a flower petal to a boy in a wheelchair; a rose bush bursts into bloom; a patient elephant reads a tiny magazine on a bench; a gardener holds up a robin's nest box; a sloth rests in a hammock between palms; a St Bernard pulls a sled with a teddy skier and a mug of cocoa; a toy robot with a dented arm waits for repair; a swan sits on her nest by the fountain, and a wooden staircase climbs to the upper floor on the right.",
